# Red Ward gives Bot2's Savannah Lions protection from red (CR 702.16). On turn 3 Bot1 cannot target the Lions with
# Burrowing, a red Aura spell (CR 702.16b; the refusal, and the runner offers it again with mana to spare), and Mons's
# Goblin Raiders attacking into it is blocked by the Lions: the Raiders' damage is red and prevented (CR 702.16e), so
# the 2/1 Lions survives with no damage marked (without Red Ward it would die) while the Raiders die.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mons's Goblin Raiders
Burrowing
Mountain
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Savannah Lions
Red Ward
Plains x12

